Fresh root-Vercel terminal execution reduced the finite semantic frontier to 193 contracts while preserving composed-effect authority 9/9 and zero unresolved internal cut sets. Two causal evidence-loss defects are visible in that exact tribunal:

1. canonical authority laws already marked `ENFORCED_BY_CODE` can reach the semantic generator with empty source/test evidence because coverage verifies the enforcement manifest separately but does not carry that pair into row `currentEvidence`;
